{"id":"nce2-010","book":"nce2","numbers":[10],"label":"Lesson 10","titleEn":"Not for Jazz","titleCn":"不适于演奏爵士乐","audio":"media/lessons/nce2/010.mp3","lines":[{"t":8.89,"en":"What happened to the clavichord?","cn":"那架古钢琴（clavichord）后来怎么样了？"},{"t":12.57,"en":"We have an old musical instrument.","cn":"我们有一件古老的乐器。"},{"t":16.1,"en":"It is called a clavichord.","cn":"它被称为“击弦琴”（clavichord）。"},{"t":18.91,"en":"It was made in Germany in 1681.","cn":"它于1681年在德国制造。"},{"t":23.78,"en":"Our clavichord is kept in the living room.","cn":"我们的古钢琴被放在客厅里。"},{"t":27.31,"en":"It has belonged to our family for a long time.","cn":"它已经属于我们家族很长时间了。"},{"t":31.61,"en":"The instrument was bought by my grandfather many years ago.","cn":"这台仪器是我祖父多年前购买的。"},{"t":36.42,"en":"Recently it was damaged by a visitor.","cn":"最近，它被一位访客损坏了。"},{"t":39.87,"en":"She tried to play jazz on it!","cn":"她试图用这台乐器演奏爵士乐！"},{"t":42.88,"en":"She struck the keys too hard and two of the strings were broken.","cn":"她用力过猛地敲击琴键，结果有两根琴弦断裂了。"},{"t":48.43,"en":"My father was shocked.","cn":"我父亲非常震惊。"},{"t":51.32,"en":"Now we are not allowed to touch it.","cn":"现在我们不被允许碰它了。"},{"t":54.36,"en":"It is being repaired by a friend of my father's.","cn":"它正在被我父亲的一个朋友修理。"}],"words":[{"word":"jazz","phonetic":["dʒæz"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"爵士音乐","us":"media/words/nce2/w0071_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0071_e.mp3"},{"word":"musical","phonetic":["'mju:zikəl"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"音乐的","us":"media/words/nce2/w0072_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0072_e.mp3"},{"word":"instrument","phonetic":["'instrumənt"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"乐器","us":"media/words/nce2/w0073_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0073_e.mp3"},{"word":"clavichord","phonetic":["'klævikɔ:d"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"古钢琴","us":"media/words/nce2/w0074_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0074_e.mp3"},{"word":"recently","phonetic":["'ri:səntli"],"pos":"ad.","meaning":"最近","us":"media/words/nce2/w0075_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0075_e.mp3"},{"word":"damage","phonetic":["'dæmidʒ"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"损坏","us":"media/words/nce2/w0076_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0076_e.mp3"},{"word":"key","phonetic":["ki:"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"琴键","us":"media/words/nce2/w0077_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0077_e.mp3"},{"word":"string","phonetic":["striŋ"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"(乐器的)弦","us":"media/words/nce2/w0078_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0078_e.mp3"},{"word":"shock","phonetic":["ʃɔk","ʃɑk"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"使不悦或生气，震惊","us":"media/words/nce2/w0079_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0079_e.mp3"},{"word":"allow","phonetic":["ə'lau"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"允许，让","us":"media/words/nce2/w0080_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0080_e.mp3"},{"word":"touch","phonetic":["tʌtʃ"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"触摸","us":"media/words/nce2/w0081_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce2/w0081_e.mp3"}]}